sequenceDiagram
    actor Tester as Security tester
    participant A as Tenant A browser/BFF
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant Guard as Host, auth, tenant guards
    participant DB as Tenant database resolver
    participant B as Tenant B data

    Tester->>A: Request Tenant A resource
    A->>API: Send host and authenticated request
    API->>Guard: Resolve tenant and authorize principal
    Guard->>DB: Select only Tenant A context
    DB-->>API: Tenant A scoped client
    API-->>A: Tenant A response
    Tester->>A: Attempt foreign id, host, token, or room
    A->>API: Malicious or mismatched request
    API->>Guard: Re-evaluate trust and ownership
    Guard-->>API: Reject or return not-found semantics
    API-->>A: Safe failure without Tenant B data
    API->>B: No read/write should occur

    Note over Guard,B: Negative tests must prove absence of cross-tenant reads, writes, cache, logs, and realtime delivery.